{
  "title": "Hearty Yeasty Dutch Mushroom Casserole",
  "description": "A low-calorie, yeasty Dutch dish featuring dried chillies and shio-cure, perfect for a weeknight dinner",
  "cuisine": "Dutch",
  "diet": [
    "low-calorie",
